From 327095b6cc519a6285a0162599e69ec1ad0bf9b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:04:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 54/54] Agents panel: status icons and agents running in Warp's
 panes

Rows show the agent's icon with the vertical tabs' status badge (in progress, done, needs
input): from Warp's own session for a conversation in one of its panes, else from the
host's status read from the session file. Agents in Warp's panes that the host doesn't
list (any CLI agent Warp detects) get their own rows at the top; clicking one goes to its
pane.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
